{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14394","headline":"吴兴送梁补阙归朝赋得荻花 · 朱长文","name":"吴兴送梁补阙归朝赋得荻花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳家汀洲孟冬月，云寒水清荻花发。\n一枝持赠朝天人，愿比蓬莱殿前雪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱长文","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}